Package: dialog-ng
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, libkf6kiofilewidgets6
Description: KDE file dialog with quick filters, cards and the NG look
 Dialog NG is KDE's open/save file dialog (from KIO) with the ideas of
 Dolphin NG: quick filters by kind of file, a cleaner sidebar, sort and view
 controls that match Dolphin NG.
 .
 It is KIO's file dialog library rebuilt with the Dialog NG changes, installed
 under /opt/ng/dialog-ng and loaded by the Plasma session in place of the
 stock one, only while it matches the installed KIO: after an update of KDE
 Frameworks the stock dialog is used until this package is rebuilt. Takes
 effect from the next login.
